---
import AlexandrosZisimidis from "../../assets/testimonial/alexandros-zisimidis.jpg";
import GuillaumeMarquis from "../../assets/testimonial/guillaume-marquis.png";
import MaximeMouchet from "../../assets/testimonial/maxime-mouchet.jpg";
import Scroll from "./TestimonialsScroll.svelte";
import Testimonial from "../ui/Testimonial.astro";
import LalitKundu from "../../assets/testimonial/lalit-kundu.jpg";
import DimitriKassubeck from "../../assets/testimonial/dimitri-kassubeck.jpg";
import SonyaRikhtverchik from "../../assets/testimonial/sonya-rikhtverchik.jpg";
import FabienDevos from "../../assets/testimonial/fabien-devos.jpg";
import EfimMirochnik from "../../assets/testimonial/efim-mirochnik.jpg";
import BaptisteArnaud from "../../assets/testimonial/baptiste-arnaud.jpg";
import GavinBains from "../../assets/testimonial/gavin-bains.jpg";
import ChristopherPrice from "../../assets/testimonial/christopher-price.jpg";
import JoshParolin from "../../assets/testimonial/josh-parolin.jpg";
import JeremieParker from "../../assets/testimonial/jeremie-parker.jpg";
import PierreDePoulpiquet from "../../assets/testimonial/pierre-de-poulpiquet.jpg";
import AdityavardhanAgrawal from "../../assets/testimonial/Adityavardhan-Agrawal.jpg";
import CamilleEpitalon from "../../assets/testimonial/Camille Epitalon.png";
---

<section
  class="bg-linear-to-b from-[#F8FAF4] from-[0%] to-white to-[100%] py-10 sm:py-20"
>
  <h2 class="text-h3 sm:text-h2 mb-3 text-center font-medium">
    Why they love us
  </h2>
  <p class="text-muted-foreground mb-12 text-center text-lg">
    Quotes from our customers
  </p>
  <Scroll client:load>
    <Testimonial
      image={AdityavardhanAgrawal}
      author="Adityavardhan Agrawal"
      role="Co-founder at Morphik"
    >
      The process was very straightforward, super fast, and best of all done for
      you with very clear and simple action items on our end.
    </Testimonial>
    <Testimonial
      image={CamilleEpitalon}
      author="Camille Epitalon"
      role="Co-founder & CTO at Verso"
    >
      Compliance that works where we already do. In Slack, async, with almost no
      back-and-forth.
    </Testimonial>
    <Testimonial
      image={PierreDePoulpiquet}
      author="Pierre de Poulpiquet"
      role="Co-founder & CTO at Whaly"
    >
      Working with Probo has been truly amazing so far; they are a true partner
      and very proactive, making our ISO certification seamless. We worked with
      Vanta in the past and didn't like the experience, but switching to Probo
      was night and day.
    </Testimonial>
    <Testimonial
      image={JeremieParker}
      author="Jérémie Parker"
      role="CTO at Trace For Good"
    >
      Probo did all the heavy lifting and kept us focused on what really
      mattered. A tailored, no-nonsense approach to compliance that made the
      whole process refreshingly smooth.
    </Testimonial>
    <Testimonial
      image={JoshParolin}
      author="Josh Parolin"
      role="Co-founder & CTO at Sessionboard"
    >
      Working with Probo was a game-changer for Sessionboard. After months of
      confusion, wasted time, and overpaying for various systems in our SOC 2
      journey, partnering with Probo finally brought clarity and momentum. Their
      team guided us every step of the way, simplifying the complex,
      anticipating our needs, and keeping us on track from start to finish.
    </Testimonial>
    <Testimonial
      image={ChristopherPrice}
      author="Christopher Price"
      role="Co-founder & COO at Sixtyfour"
    >
      Probo was an excellent experience. The team was extremely professional,
      prompt and communicative. Having experienced Vanta, Drata, and now Probo,
      it makes it a no-brainer to recommend Probo for teams that need to get
      complaint quickly.
    </Testimonial>
    <Testimonial
      image={GavinBains}
      author="Gavin Bains"
      role="Co-founder at The LLM Data Company"
    >
      Probo makes SOC 2 painless. They guided us step-by-step, kept us
      organized, and did all the heavy lifting to get us audit-ready. This team
      deeply cares about their customers and it shows.
    </Testimonial>
    <Testimonial
      image={BaptisteArnaud}
      author="Baptiste Arnaud"
      role="Founder at Typebot"
    >
      Probo made getting ISO 27001 certified simple, fast, and human. Their
      open-source approach, direct Slack support, and ability to adapt to a
      one-person company made all the difference.
    </Testimonial>
    <Testimonial
      image={EfimMirochnik}
      author="Efim Mirochnik"
      role="CISO at Ahrefs"
    >
      Probo has been a true partner. They adapted compliance and security to our
      daily jobs, took the heavy lifting and enabled us to move faster than
      expected.
    </Testimonial>
    <Testimonial
      image={FabienDevos}
      author="Fabien Devos"
      role="Co-founder & CTO at Vybe"
    >
      Probo made the SOC2 process seamless, their support went way beyond what I
      expected. It's the first time I actually enjoyed compliance.
    </Testimonial>
    <Testimonial
      image={SonyaRikhtverchik}
      author="Sonya Rikhtverchik"
      role="COO at Vybe"
    >
      Probo made the terrifying chore of SOC 2 compliance seem like a walk in
      Jardin des Tuileries.
    </Testimonial>
    <Testimonial
      image={DimitriKassubeck}
      author="Dimitri Kassubeck"
      role="Co-founder & CEO at Moby Analytics"
    >
      Compliance, done right. Experts who focus on what truly matters. Hassle
      free - just one mission: make you more secure.
    </Testimonial>
    <Testimonial
      image={LalitKundu}
      author="Lalit Kundu"
      role="Co-founder & CEO at Delty"
    >
      Probo team made SOC 2 compliance a smooth sail for us, working closely on
      explaining and implementing the controls, and even helped us go through
      vendor security for big enterprise contracts. They demystify the whole
      compliance process, I couldn't recommend them more for any startup.
    </Testimonial>
    <Testimonial
      image={MaximeMouchet}
      author="Maxime Mouchet"
      role="Co-founder & CTO at Clarifeye"
    >
      Our customers have high security expectations. We needed a partner who
      took compliance as seriously as we do. Probo was rigorous, responsive, and
      fast - exactly what we needed to get it done right.
    </Testimonial>
    <Testimonial
      image={GuillaumeMarquis}
      author="Guillaume Marquis"
      role="Co-founder & CEO at Basalt"
    >
      Probo has been the ideal compliance partner. They built security and
      compliance around how we work, took on the heavy lifting and delivered
      fast.
    </Testimonial>
    <Testimonial
      image={AlexandrosZisimidis}
      author="Alexandros Zisimidis"
      role="Co-founder & COO at Cleon"
    >
      Unlike typical compliance vendors that push every certification under the
      sun, Probo actually helps us think through which standards make sense for
      our business. They guide us through each decision with clarity and never
      pressure us toward unnecessary licenses. It's refreshing to work with a
      compliance partner who prioritizes what we actually need.
    </Testimonial>
  </Scroll>
</section>

<section class="bg-white py-10 sm:py-20">
  <div class="container mb-10 max-w-3xl text-center">
    <p class="text-muted-foreground mb-3 text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.14em]">
      ZebraByte extension
    </p>
    <h2 class="text-h3 sm:text-h2 mb-3 font-medium">
      Ce spun clienții ZebraByte
    </h2>
    <p class="text-muted-foreground text-lg">
      Feedback real păstrat din website-ul ZebraByte, adăugat după sliderul Probo original fără să îl înlocuiască.
    </p>
  </div>

  <Scroll client:load>
    <Testimonial author="Cosmin Szavui" role="Google review">
      Am avut site-ul plin de viruși și tot timpul îmi dădea erori. Nu mai mergea cum trebuie și nimeni nu știa ce are. Cei de la ZebraByte m-au ajutat imediat au curățat tot, au securizat site-ul și l-au mutat pe serverele lor. De atunci merge perfect și nu am mai avut nicio problemă. Se vede că știu ce fac și chiar se implică. Recomand 100%!
    </Testimonial>
    <Testimonial author="Alexandra Aless" role="Google review">
      Am început să colaborez cu Zebrabyte de câteva luni și au livrat mai mult decât m-am asteptat. Am decis să îmi mut site-ul la ei deoarece am avut probleme cu vechiul provider și era și virusat. Cei de la ZebraByte au standarde foarte ridicate in ceea ce priveste securitatea și hosting enterprise. Echipa lor este foarte profesionistă, răspunde rapid la orice întrebare, oferă soluții clare si explica pe înțelesul tuturor chiar daca nu ai cunostinte tehnice. Platformele de hosting sunt stabile, rapide și bine protejate. Recomand cu încredere oricărei companii care are nevoie de hosting enterprise sigur și de suport solid în zona de securitate IT.
    </Testimonial>
    <Testimonial author="Stefania Iancu" role="Google review">
      Am avut o problemă urâtă cu site-ul, tot primeam alerte de securitate și linkuri ciudate apăreau peste tot. Cei de la ZebraByte au intrat imediat, au curățat tot și l-au mutat la ei. De atunci merge fără probleme, chiar și mai repede. Foarte serioși!
    </Testimonial>
    <Testimonial author="Bănuță Cristina" role="Google review">
      Super profi! Am colaborat foarte bine cu aceasta echipa. Toate cerintele au fost rezolvate intr-un timp foarte scurt. Recomand!
    </Testimonial>
    <Testimonial author="Jadu Ro" role="Google review">
      Am lucrat extraordinar cu aceasta echipa. Ii recomand!
    </Testimonial>
    <Testimonial author="Morosanu Gabriel" role="Trustpilot review">
      Very good team! Best cooperation i have ever seen. 10 stars!!!
    </Testimonial>
    <Testimonial author="Ijugin Gowtham" role="Trustpilot review">
      I couldn’t be happier with the web hosting services from ZebraByte UK! Not only is my website running smoothly and reliably, but they also gave me a fantastic bonus—free business listing services. Their support team is just as amazing—always quick to assist and genuinely helpful.
    </Testimonial>
    <Testimonial author="Laviclinic Jacob" role="Trustpilot review">
      It was really nice to design my website by Zebrabyte! The team was helpful and they established everything from A to Z, I liked the suggestions they gave. I’d like to thank Mr. Liviu especially for his assist.
    </Testimonial>
    <Testimonial author="Florin novac" role="Trustpilot review">
      A expert team and very friendly. I recommend 100% and thank you for your hard work.
    </Testimonial>
    <Testimonial author="Gabriela Ferguson" role="Trustpilot review">
      Excellent service, very understanding and patient with all our requests. I fully recommend ZebraByte for website designs to suit your needs!
    </Testimonial>
    <Testimonial author="Callum Jones" role="Trustpilot review">
      The website was easy to understand and use. The support given helped me out to figure some of the website, the support was amazing and fast. I would recommend this app to anyone trying to host their own website.
    </Testimonial>
  </Scroll>
</section>
